Source: tekne-branding
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tekne project <noreply@tekne.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), librsvg2-bin
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: tekne-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, base-files
# satori's packages until the rename (DEC-008). Conflicts makes apt remove
# satori-branding (and its diversions) before this package is unpacked.
Conflicts: satori-branding
Replaces: satori-branding
Description: Tekne branding: os-release, GRUB theme, wallpaper and logo
 Identifies the system as Tekne: /usr/lib/os-release (and so
 /etc/os-release) describes Tekne, with Devuan's copy diverted to
 /usr/lib/os-release.devuan so that base-files upgrades can't restore it.
 .
 Also ships Tekne's GRUB theme (copied to /boot/grub/themes/tekne, which
 GRUB can read before an encrypted root is unlocked), the default wallpaper
 and the logo. The artwork is licensed CC-BY-SA-4.0.
